12
00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.260
You're the mighty dragon king.

13
00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:44.260
You never wanted to trust a human in the first place.

14
00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.260
That's why I'm running away from you.

15
00:00:46.260 --> 00:01:05.860
Until the bloodline test result comes out, you're staying in the castle.

16
00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:07.860
With me.

17
00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:08.860
I will not-

18
00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:09.860
Lyra.

19
00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:11.860
Amber is sick.

20
00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.860
That's why you risked coming back to find Thaddeus.

21
00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:17.860
Is that right?

22
00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:22.730
Stay.

23
00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:30.890
I swear on my crown as the dragon king.

24
00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.890
No matter what the test reveals in three days,

25
00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:37.890
I'll do everything in my power to heal Amber.

26
00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:41.890
And whatever you need, I'll give it to you.

27
